---
title: Thanh toán thẻ · confirm pending stripe/braintree
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant A0 as Browser
    participant A1 as CheckoutPayment
    participant A2 as PaymentGateway
    participant A3 as Gateway HTTP
    participant A4 as ModelAccountOrder
    A0->>A1: POST confirm → check isLogged + pending
    A1->>A2: chargeStripe(...) hoặc chargeBraintree(...)
    A2->>A3: Stripe API hoặc Braintree GraphQL
    A3->>A2: error / transaction_id
    A1->>A1: Nếu không lỗi: unset pending; gắn transaction_id nếu có
    A1->>A4: addOrder(order_data)
    A1->>A0: JSON error hoặc order_id + success
